lickbacks Blue. And then before that we had Girls Maya. I've got Infant coming up next. Text in. Let me know what you guys think. The text number is 0435123945."}, {"start": "01:18:15", "end": "01:18:57", "text": "94.5 FM. I'm Carly. I'm covering tonight on Variable Depth Audit. Right there we had Eek's QL Allergic to Winning and then before that we had Chickens Make Myself Over and then just before that Amber Sun ESP. I'm playing a bunch of random stuff tonight new and old all different genres i hope you like it um send in a text let me know what you think 0435 123 945 um next up we have dj courtman dog fear"}, {"start": "01:30:46", "end": "01:31:19", "text": "You're listening to FBi Radio, DJ Smooth, Toxic, um, crazy song, makes me dance. Um, and then before that, Nation and DJ Stingray with We Up. Um, I'm about to do Back to Back, Agazero, just being my latest obsession. Um, yeah, you're listening to FBi Radio, this is Variable Depth Audit. I'm Carly, I'm covering for Youngist tonight. Hope you guys like the show Sweet"}, {"start": "01:48:11", "end": "01:48:35", "text": "You're listening to FBi Radio. This is Variable Depth Audit. That there was Craves Vein Attention by Agazero. And then before that we had Apeak and Croatian armour with one of our mornings. Marmalade on the Moon coming up soon. Don't go anywhere."}, {"start": "01:49:40", "end": "01:50:39", "text": ""}, {"start": "01:50:51", "end": "01:52:12", "text": ""}, {"start": "01:52:24", "end": "01:53:29", "text": ""}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:00:00"}, "track": {"title": "Roll Wit Me VIP", "artists": [{"name": "DJ Phil"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:06:00"}, "track": {"title": "What Is Techno (Himbrecht Remix)", "artists": [{"name": "Blue Amazon"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:07:00"}, "track": {"title": "Deep Fear (Lumberjack & Brømance R